                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b847a7ff-0591-36b5-b4fe-5e1fc1613159",
                        "entry_id": "4a7aef3a-9563-3e83-8821-90373f863806",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a comfortable manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e66d72ee-0a0f-4bb6-aaeb-47c3b625eb8b",
                                "sense_id": "b847a7ff-0591-36b5-b4fe-5e1fc1613159",
                                "text": "I snuggled comfortably into the blankets."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e3c2490-4431-4d92-9ef0-29a12c2f4737",
                                "sense_id": "b847a7ff-0591-36b5-b4fe-5e1fc1613159",
                                "text": "Platform faces in Holland are further back from the track than they are in Britain, and it is a common thing to see a driver standing quite comfortably between his engine and the platform while oiling the motion."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "55f95739-14fa-3ad3-b9b3-db98f1073abc",
                        "entry_id": "4a7aef3a-9563-3e83-8821-90373f863806",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Easily; without effort or difficulty."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b05340fd-531c-4ecf-b822-05e6c53708f4",
                                "sense_id": "55f95739-14fa-3ad3-b9b3-db98f1073abc",
                                "text": "Messi was the next to test Cech with a header from Sanchez's cross, the Chelsea keeper gathering the effort comfortably as Barcelona once more failed to produce the final touch to accompany their artistic approach work."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b4860bf-976b-4a38-94f3-3f8d62cd61d7",
                                "sense_id": "55f95739-14fa-3ad3-b9b3-db98f1073abc",
                                "text": "A drag queen may not comfortably fit the stereotypical homesteader mold. In the 19th century, homesteaders were Western pioneers who built new lives from necessity; on TikTok, the most popular homesteaders are often parents with young families or those with a lifelong connection to the practice, which often include so-called “tradwives,” or women who play a stereotypically gendered role in their family."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ea811cbc-087c-4537-ac8a-05c7f9b8d42c",
                        "source_entry_id": "4a7aef3a-9563-3e83-8821-90373f863806",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a comfortable manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "pohodlně",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40944f51-c483-402c-900c-46b66a59db6f",
                        "source_entry_id": "4a7aef3a-9563-3e83-8821-90373f863806",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a comfortable manner",
                        "target_lang_word": "confortablement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "confortablement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                        "entry_id": "0e9a0506-22d9-3583-8c51-492c1fafa7d5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière confortable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04f9dec3-bf4b-45ba-b4a0-76fbbcd02bb2",
                                                "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                                "text": "Le bateau était un brick-goélette de quatre-vingts tonneaux à peu près, confortablement aménagé, avec, sur le pont, trois cabines spacieuses."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7b1cbd9-ec92-41a0-a24d-9d3410337f47",
                                                "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                                "text": "[…]; les cités ouvrières ont confortablement remplacé les antiques houbettes (huttes) que les ouvriers verriers se construisaient jadis à l’instar des bûcherons, […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2560c11b-e6f9-424d-921a-a4bd67670da3",
                                                "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                                "text": "Deux autres voyageurs se trouvant logés à la même enseigne que moi, nous allons trouver un loueur de voitures qui se charge de nous transporter à notre destination pour la somme de 13 pesetas; et, quelques minutes plus tard, nous sommes confortablement installés dans un léger véhicule attelé de deux bons chevaux qui ne tardent pas à rattraper et à dépasser le coche public."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70f0fbef-edb8-477e-8666-c02990d67753",
                                                "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                                "text": "Les deux sœurs se casaient, plus ou moins confortablement mariées, et l'aînée, sacrifiant à la tradition, enfantait régulièrement deux fois tous les trois ans."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff779fca-6369-4c13-8d2c-d13f0363531f",
                                                "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                                "text": "Nous nous affalons côte à côte dans le grand canapé blanc, moelleux comme un marshmallow géant ; mon corps s'enfonce confortablement dans les coussins tandis que Damen attrape la télécommande et se blottit contre moi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "371c74da-2902-4f4c-919f-5a51c9a3259a",
                                                "sense_id": "2145e3fd-4c0d-374f-af83-878c297cda51",
                                                "text": "Leri fixa Moreta, bouche bée de stupeur.\n— Une zoonose ? Même le terme est rébarbatif ! (Elle arrangea un coussin derrière son dos.) Eh bien, maintenant que je suis confortablement assise, racontez-moi tout."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
